{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026KgQi2fJNAF1793051874.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：一股清勁至強風程度的東北季候風補充會在今晚抵達廣東沿岸，未來一兩日該區風勢較大。隨著高空反氣旋增強，本周後期廣東天色普遍晴朗，內陸地區日夜溫差頗大。預料另一股東北季候風會在下周初至中期影響華南。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：早晚部分時間多雲及有幾陣雨。日間大致天晴，最高氣溫約30度。吹和緩至清勁東至東北風，晚上離岸間中吹強風。</p><p></p><p>展望：未來數日天色大致良好。明日至星期四初時風勢較大。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T23:00:26.702962+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T22:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T11:58:19.296740+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T22:58:15.224549+00:00","content_hash":"55a881851824013ab41339dd06a4a5ce0a391242db1059435afff2ff7e02dc0a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T23:00:26.702962+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}